      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i'll try some of those. it's just driving me mad because it feels like there's something invisible messing with the build. like there's no pattern at all. it's just totally erratic. have you ever seen anything like this where the failures seem almost... intentional or just completely random? like it's just breaking things for the hell of it?",
